desc: Comment out every line with '# '
category: manual
par: 7
hint1: Visual block mode can insert on many lines at once
hint2: Ctrl-V to select a column, I to insert before it, Esc to apply to all
solution: <C-V>jjI# <Esc>
note: <C-V> starts visual block; jj extends down; I inserts at the start of every
note: selected line; type '# ', then <Esc> applies it to all of them.
--- START ---
alpha
beta
gamma
--- GOAL ---
# alpha
# beta
# gamma
--- END ---
